    #user stories

    Scenario: Create a tier promotion with a unique name, detailed description, audience group, start date, reset frequency, buffer period, tiered entity and tier assignment method.

    Scenario: Tier promotion name, start date, reset frequency, buffer days, tiered entity and tier assignment method will be non-editable after promotion is published

    Scenario: Prevent the creation of a new tier promotion if an existing promotion is in 'active' or 'on-hold' status without first closing the active one

    Scenario: Admin can choose between participant level or organization level tiering for each promotion








